e this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Miss Marple</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n54:[\"$\",\"p\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Meowssolini</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bilbo Waggins</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n56:[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chewbacca</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Notorious D.O.G.</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Wahlberg</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Tsunami</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Lady GaGa</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Joan Jett</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"51–60\"]}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dog the Bounty Hunter</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Princess Leia Organa</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Salvador Dogi</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"p\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky Bark</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"p\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Isaac Mewton</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n62:[\"$\",\"p\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pat Sajak</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Gandalf the Greyhound</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n64:[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woof Blitzer</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n65:[\"$\",\"p\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pablo Escobark</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Kibble Bryant</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n67:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"61–70\"]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Fleaonce</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jane Pawsten</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Frodo Baggins</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Monsoon</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pupperoni</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Simpson</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Volcano</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Neil Armcat</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chairman Meow</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pawdrey Plaza</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n72:[\"$\",\"p\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 70 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n77:[\"$\",\"p\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n79:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"96\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/angelfish/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Angelfish\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"100\",{\"href\":\"/animal/manatee/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Manatee\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"117\",{\"href\":\"/animal/dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"130\",{\"href\":\"/animal/pig/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Pig\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"147\",{\"href\":\"/animal/marten/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Marten\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n80:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I choose between multiple name options?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Try each name for a full day. Say it often, use it during play, and see which one feels most natural. The name that makes you smile every time is the winner. Trust your instincts!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can my pet have a middle name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! Many pet owners give middle names — especially useful for when your pet is being mischievous. 'Luna Bean Smith, stop that!' has a certain ring to it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should pet names match pet insurance registration?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Use the same name consistently across vet records, microchips, and insurance. In an emergency, a consistent name helps veterinary staff quickly identify and treat your pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if I change my pet's name after adoption?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Adult pets can learn new names with patience. Use lots of treats and positive reinforcement. Most pets adjust within a few weeks. Consistency is key.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n81:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"goldfish\",{\"href\":\"/animal/goldfish/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐠\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Goldfish\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"ethiopian-wolf\",{\"href\":\"/animal/ethiopian-wolf/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐺\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Ethiopian Wolf\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"bottlenose-dolphin\",{\"href\":\"/animal/bottlenose-dolphin/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":